 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZxyfK5RfIXAQ7kNvwGHkn03&_nc_oc=AdrGlhGubDIT7UnaxLZmTWQ16Fk3gwGvEvRtl7AJTH7_ydKKiiyfyGslKLK0QWAQFMc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO7xz2d9COasLmvXT8UZd9qN23HBRsEABA-p3Dk6mhHoA&oe=6AE363C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gQpclQDI61oQ7kNvwHQfTuZ&_nc_oc=AdqK-3aeppI7BVEOuHOpq0YJcWtSTlc7cJr8pX-7EZguOWeVPRe4Rg2rsZYejprIVVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMfll9PxoCmRI9YC6-L0oCzQT40qfnagytLK5ki3_WTUw&oe=6AE338E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ei6739YDHvwQ7kNvwF5IQCh&_nc_oc=AdopA9KDX3A_hPZb8AnX7XefXSBlUxX5E-mLarN6anIGwAFgg2qy3Yb7lVPb81AuPbk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNdW3eLBz3cb1DyQINiFDZnybRbYjekdNS3aHHMtraY5w&oe=6AE342DC"}, {"fil